--- !u!114 &4528511944736951566
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4783724153337013618}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3125c85e9da23194b857ccc15a3e00fb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  startingNode:
    npcSentence: "A curious fresher in these realms huh? \u2014 Greetings! I am a
      researcher here."
    playerOptions:
    - optionText: What do you work on?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: "Most our work involves low level programming I\u2019d say"
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Did not understand
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: "It\u2019s like making the tools to develop your final product."
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bb656d7d04e4e114bb55fb13102a7c0a, type: 3}
        - optionText: Examples?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Shader programming, AI/ML in game, physics and GPU programming
              and a lot more
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a69957c096124a41adca0c3273c3e60, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6f3addd34b458f7408bebc888dbe997d, type: 3}
    - optionText: "Are you all \u2013 like buried in books the entire day?"
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: Nah no, seems you are funnier than you are curious
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: I was seriously asking
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: "Umm no, there\u2019s some reading involved but a lot is
              about experimenting."
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6082cbcdbbe1038488cf7e1271df95fd, type: 3}
        - optionText: Yeah sure I am.
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Sure but yeah, we experiment game mechanics, graphics and
              stuff mostly
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd4503076163e934ab8fd976a8d2bbb0, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7fa3822779da1bc45abe3e0c10c417ec, type: 3}
    - optionText: Sounds tough.
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: Very few walk this path passerby
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Researchers are less that means?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Uh no, I was kidding, toughness depends on what you choose
              to do research on
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6abe84424c96cfa459de1192be84d1f9, type: 3}
        - optionText: It is tough then?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: The only part that I find tough is running out of ideas
              to implement.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba56f14df031ed440b1b4bbdb0d394af, type: 3}
        - optionText: Why do people randomly call me passerby here?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Not sure, the game development guy might know.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f3190d354c18844ba421d2f7f3ed6bf, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eef41ce8bbcf77a4394ec2e9bb9d3335, type: 3}
    - optionText: ' You reckon I can do it?'
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: At the moment? Maybe no
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Why??
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: You can after you have had some understanding about game
              mechanics and graphics
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8a6cc7565c378f45acb4c9f23814b9a, type: 3}
        - optionText: Other portfolios got better seniors atleast they think I can
            do it
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: You will walk this path one day passerby and truly understand
              my message that day
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d939a2790fd48454fb4e4fb0a2a0b7b4, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 445e2803eb4c2e548bae502ebb97567c, type: 3}
    voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4921c6b93ee8fac4f8ee1dca2a1aeb28, type: 3}
